---
const ariaLabel =
  "Simulazione da terminale: un nodo spot riceve l'avviso di interruzione, Understudy trattiene l'eviction, avvia un pod sostituto, aspetta che sia pronto e solo allora lascia uscire l'originale. Il probe registra 764 richieste, 1 fallita.";
---

<figure class="terminal" data-terminal>
  <figcaption class="bar">
    <span class="bar-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="bar-title">produzione — eks · karpenter · spot</span>
    <button class="replay" data-replay hidden aria-label="Rivedi l'animazione">↻ rivedi</button>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="body" role="img" aria-label={ariaLabel}>
    <div aria-hidden="true">
      <p class="tl cmd" style="--d: 0.15s"><span class="typed">$ kubectl get pods -w -l app=tenant-worker</span></p>
      <p class="tl dim" style="--d: 1.5s">NAME                         READY  STATUS</p>
      <p class="tl" style="--d: 1.7s">tenant-worker-6d8f7c-x2k4q   1/1    <span class="ok">Running</span></p>
      <p class="tl warn" style="--d: 3.1s">! spot interruption: node spot-arm64-a7f3 (2m)</p>
      <p class="tl op" style="--d: 3.9s">understudy: holding eviction, starting stand-in</p>
      <p class="tl" style="--d: 4.7s">tenant-worker-6d8f7c-p9d2m   0/1    <span class="dim">Pending</span></p>
      <p class="tl" style="--d: 6.6s">tenant-worker-6d8f7c-p9d2m   1/1    <span class="ok">Running</span></p>
      <p class="tl op" style="--d: 7.4s">understudy: stand-in ready, releasing original</p>
      <p class="tl bye" style="--d: 8.2s">tenant-worker-6d8f7c-x2k4q   1/1    <span class="warn">Terminating</span></p>
      <p class="tl probe" style="--d: 9.6s">probe: <strong>764 requests, 1 failed</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<p class="mt-4 max-w-[56ch] text-s text-carta/65">
  Non è un'animazione di fantasia: su un'interruzione spot reale il probe ha misurato{' '}
  <strong class="font-semibold text-carta">1 richiesta fallita su 764</strong>. Un rolling
  update di routine ne perde 2 su 38.{' '}
  <a href="#kubernetes" class="text-lichene underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline"
    >I numeri, più sotto</a
  >.
</p>

<style>
  .terminal {
    background-color: var(--color-schermo);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-carta) 14%, transparent);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 60px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-lichene) 9%, transparent),
      0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-carta) 10%, transparent);
  }

  .bar-dot {
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    background-color: var(--color-lichene);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bar-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-carta) 55%, transparent);
  }

  .replay {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-carta) 65%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-carta) 20%, transparent);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 150ms;
  }
  .replay:hover {
    color: var(--color-carta);
  }

  .body {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .tl {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(0.64rem, 0.42rem + 1vw, 0.8125rem);
    line-height: 1.85;
    white-space: pre;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-carta) 88%, transparent);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .terminal.play .tl {
    animation: reveal 220ms ease-out var(--d) both;
  }

  .dim {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-carta) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .ok {
    color: var(--color-lichene);
  }
  .op {
    color: var(--color-lichene);
  }
  .warn {
    color: var(--color-salmone);
  }
  .probe {
    margin-top: 0.9em;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-carta) 70%, transparent);
  }
  .probe strong {
    color: var(--color-carta);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .terminal.play .bye {
    animation:
      reveal 220ms ease-out var(--d) both,
      dimout 500ms ease-out 9.1s forwards;
  }

  .cmd .typed {
    display: inline-block;
    overflow: hidden;
    vertical-align: bottom;
    max-width: 42ch;
    border-right: 0.45em solid var(--color-lichene);
  }
  .terminal.play .cmd .typed {
    animation:
      typing 1.1s steps(42) 0.15s backwards,
      caret 0.9s step-end 0.15s 3;
  }

  @keyframes reveal {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(3px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
  @keyframes dimout {
    to {
      opacity: 0.32;
    }
  }
  @keyframes typing {
    from {
      max-width: 0;
    }
    to {
      max-width: 42ch;
    }
  }
  @keyframes caret {
    0%,
    100% {
      border-color: var(--color-lichene);
    }
    50% {
      border-color: transparent;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .tl,
    .terminal.play .tl {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .bye,
    .terminal.play .bye {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 0.32;
    }
    .cmd .typed,
    .terminal.play .cmd .typed {
      animation: none;
      border-right: none;
    }
    .replay {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<noscript>
  <style>
    [data-terminal] .tl {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    [data-terminal] .tl:nth-last-child(2) {
      opacity: 0.32;
    }
    [data-terminal] .cmd span {
      border-right: none;
    }
  </style>
</noscript>

<script>
  const terminal = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-terminal]');
  const replay = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-replay]');
  const reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

  if (terminal) {
    const play = () => {
      terminal.classList.remove('play');
      void terminal.offsetWidth;
      terminal.classList.add('play');
    };

    if (reduced || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
      terminal.classList.add('play');
    } else {
      const io = new IntersectionObserver(
        (entries) => {
          if (entries.some((e) => e.isIntersecting)) {
            play();
            io.disconnect();
            if (replay) {
              setTimeout(() => {
                replay.hidden = false;
              }, 10500);
            }
          }
        },
        { threshold: 0.4 },
      );
      io.observe(terminal);
    }

    replay?.addEventListener('click', play);
  }
</script>
